          "relation": "states",
          "snippet": {
            "line": 495,
            "text": "theorem inverse_solves_smooth_torus (d : Direction) (f : C(Torus, ℂ))\n    (hf : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (torusLift f)) (hmean : (∫ z, f z ∂torusMeasure) = 0) (x : Plane) :\n    fderiv ℝ (directionalInverse d (coefficient (torusLift f))) x (vector d) =\n      torusLift f x"
